18	 * owners that existed before this create (and so never matches the owner being built), and
19	 * mutates the built {@link Owner} in place. When several owners match, the one with the lowest
20	 * id is reported, so the result is deterministic. Last names are compared case-insensitively
21	 * (as elsewhere, e.g. {@link AssignOwnerNamesakeCount}); postcode and telephone are compared in
22	 * their stored, normalized form.
